-- The scope of a fold can be a live alias: ^party is the sidecar's mask and ^empty selects nothing. Identity folds answer their registered identities on the empty scope; max/ and avg/ declare none and print no row at all (A12); #/ declares 0.
-- !^party negates the resolved mask, so the sigiled and negated golds partition the column's total of 210.
--! registry ../registries/028-reductions.reg

--! out 150
+/ Gold @ Nord

--! out 155
+/ Gold @ ^party

--! out 3
#/ ^party

def rest = !^party

--! out 55
+/ Gold @ rest

--! out 0.09375
*/ (1 - Resist) @ Hits

--! out 0
+/ Gold @ ^empty

--! out 1
*/ (1 - Resist) @ ^empty

--! out 0
#/ ^empty

--! out
max/ Gold @ ^empty

--! out
avg/ Gold @ ^empty
